---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Clinical Standards & Ethics | Nepal Hypnosis" description="Learn about the strict ethical guidelines, confidentiality standards, and professional practices upheld at Nepal Hypnosis in Kathmandu.">
  <main class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-[#e2e8f0]">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase mb-3 block">Professional Integrity</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-6">Clinical Standards & Ethics</h1>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-[#475569] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#173A7A]">
          At Nepal Hypnosis, ethical practice, absolute confidentiality, and client safety form the foundation of everything we do.
        </p>
        <p>
          Established in 2012 AD, our clinic operates under rigorous professional codes of conduct aligned with international psychotherapy standards and local ethical obligations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] pt-4">Our Core Commitments</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Absolute Confidentiality:</strong> All therapeutic interactions and client records are strictly protected under professional privilege.</li>
          <li><strong>Individualized Care:</strong> Treatment plans are customized to honor each client's psychological autonomy and background.</li>
          <li><strong>Transparent Boundaries:</strong> The scope of practice, fees, session durations, and safety limits are clearly communicated from the outset.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-8 bg-[#F5F1EA] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-2">Have Questions Regarding Our Standards?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4">We are happy to address any inquiries regarding our clinical policies and session confidentiality.</p>
          <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
            Contact Us →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>